	<TextRow
		Label="msg_t07r0201_fighterw_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>むむ！　この　わたしに
はなしかけるとは……▼
なかなかの　トレーナーね
あなた　きにいったわ！▽
わざマシンを　うけとりなさい！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-14T10:33:35" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-14T10:33:35" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>むむ！　この　わたしに
話しかけるとは……▼
なかなかの　トレーナーね
あなた　気に入ったわ！▽
わざマシンを　受け取りなさい！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-14T10:33:35" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-14T10:33:35" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♀
・技マシン入手前
　アイテム入手処理
　No384「チャージビーム」</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-14T10:33:50" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>FIGHTREW
格闘家♀</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-14T10:33:35" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Importance">
			<Text>C</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-08T10:34:18" />
		</AttributeCell>
